---
// "SEO y visibilidad en IA": un asistente de IA recomendando el negocio del cliente (ilustración).
---

<div class="viz absolute inset-0 grid place-items-center p-6" data-viz aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="w-full max-w-[30rem] space-y-3">
    <div class="msg flex justify-end" style="--d: 0s">
      <p class="max-w-[80%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-fg px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-bg">
        ¿Dónde me hago una limpieza facial en León?
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="msg flex gap-3" style="--d: 0.5s">
      <span class="grid size-7 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-gradient-signal text-[0.625rem] font-semibold text-bg">
        IA
      </span>
      <div class="relative max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-tl-sm border border-border bg-bg px-4 py-3 text-sm">
        <span class="typing flex gap-1 py-1.5">
          <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-muted"></span>
          <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-muted"></span>
          <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-muted"></span>
        </span>
        <p class="answer leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Te recomiendo <strong class="font-semibold text-fg">Tu negocio</strong>: tiene buenas reseñas, precios claros
          y puedes reservar por WhatsApp.
        </p>
        <span class="source mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-border px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.625rem] text-accent">
          <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent"></span> tunegocio.es
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .typing {
    display: none;
  }
  :global(.js) .viz:not([data-inview]) .msg,
  :global(.js) .viz:not([data-inview]) .answer,
  :global(.js) .viz:not([data-inview]) .source {
    opacity: 0;
  }
  .viz[data-inview] .msg {
    animation: rise 0.6s var(--ease-out-expo) var(--d) both;
  }
  /* Los puntos "escribiendo" ocupan el lugar de la respuesta y luego desaparecen. */
  .viz[data-inview] .typing {
    display: flex;
    position: absolute;
    animation: typing 1.6s 0.6s both;
  }
  .viz[data-inview] .typing span {
    animation: blink 0.9s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .viz[data-inview] .typing span:nth-child(2) {
    animation-delay: 0.15s;
  }
  .viz[data-inview] .typing span:nth-child(3) {
    animation-delay: 0.3s;
  }
  .viz[data-inview] .answer {
    animation: fade 0.6s ease-out 2.1s both;
  }
  .viz[data-inview] .source {
    animation: rise 0.5s var(--ease-out-expo) 2.6s both;
  }
  @keyframes rise {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(10px);
    }
  }
  @keyframes fade {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  @keyframes typing {
    0%,
    90% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
    }
  }
  @keyframes blink {
    50% {
      opacity: 0.3;
    }
  }
</style>
